This modest package contains various common humanization utilities, like
turning a
number into a fuzzy human-readable duration ("3 minutes ago") or into a
human-readable
size or throughput. It is localized to:

- Arabic
- Basque
- Bengali
- Brazilian Portuguese
- Catalan
- Danish
- Dutch
- Esperanto
- European Portuguese
- Finnish
- French
- German
- Greek
- Hebrew
